# ── Avery frontend (static SPA) · build-time env — TEMPLATE (committed, NO secrets) ──────────────
# feat-018 (ADR-0021 §5) dual deploy. Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time into the static bundle.
# There are NO secrets here — the LLM keys live server-side in the agent service, never the frontend
# (ADR-0020 决策 4). Copy per target to a gitignored `.env.local` OR pass inline to `vite build`.
#
#   real files (.env.local / .env.*.local) are gitignored — see .gitignore `.env*.local`.
#
# ── Build-time vars ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   VITE_AVERY_MODE      story (default) | live      — feat-017 src/live/mode.ts.
#                        Deploy builds set `live` so the graduated product is the default surface;
#                        `?mode=story` still flips to the scripted rail on-site (路演/video).
#   VITE_AVERY_LOCALE    en (default) | zh           — feat-018 src/i18n/index.ts.
#                        境内 build sets `zh` to default to Chinese with no query param; `?lang=en`
#                        still overrides on-site. Overseas build leaves it unset -> EN default.
#   VITE_AVERY_API_BASE  agent service base URL      — feat-017 src/live/transport.ts.
#                        Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8137 (local dev). Set to the deployed service
#                        origin per target (境内 host for ZH, overseas host for EN).
#
# ── Target presets (see docs/deploy/dual-deploy-runbook.md for the full matrix) ──────────────────
#
# Overseas EN (Vercel):   VITE_AVERY_MODE=live   VITE_AVERY_LOCALE=  (unset)  VITE_AVERY_API_BASE=https://<overseas-service>
# 境内 ZH (static host):  VITE_AVERY_MODE=live   VITE_AVERY_LOCALE=zh         VITE_AVERY_API_BASE=https://<境内-service>
#
# Uncomment + fill for a LOCAL build test (or use scripts/build-targets.mjs which sets these itself):
# VITE_AVERY_MODE=live
# VITE_AVERY_LOCALE=zh
# VITE_AVERY_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8137

# ── feat-053 账号体系（Supabase auth）· 可选 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   两个都设 → 顶栏出现账号入口（注册/登录/登出/会话恢复）。
#   任一缺失 → 账号层整体休眠，UI 不出登录入口，应用照常当游客用。
#
# 🔴 硬约束：**不许把 key 写进代码**，只走这两个变量（真值放 .env.local，已 gitignore）。
#    anon/publishable key 按设计是公开的（它会被打进浏览器 bundle），不是密钥——
#    真正的权限边界在后端：owner_token（feat-038）+ avery.account_contexts（feat-053）。
#
# 🔴 **绝不能把整个应用挡在登录墙后面**：没登录必须能打开、能上传、能问。
#    登录只决定"这份公司数据归不归你账号名下"。
#
# 当前项目（Supabase org secovmnayetazfeoesbm）：avery-fra / ref zlxpldzapyoacmgvlqpn
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://zlxpldzapyoacmgvlqpn.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<Supabase 控制台 → Project Settings → API Keys → publishable>
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
